    {
      "kind": "module",
      "name": "CARDDEMO",
      "key_points": [
        "Credit card back office: users sign on to CICS screens to view and update accounts, cards and users, add and list transactions and pay bills against VSAM files.",
        "A nightly batch stream posts the day's card transactions (rejecting invalid card, unknown account, over-limit and expired-account items), accrues interest and fees, and produces the transaction report and customer statements."
